Name":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1152278914,"text":"ちびっこ、俺は本当にダイビングはできないんだ。見ろ、潜水服も着てないんだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746730102]},{"nodeId":746730102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2146648378,"text":"はぁ…いくらそうやって飛び跳ねても、一緒に潜るわけにはいかないって…","nextNodeIds":[746730103,746730104]},{"nodeId":746730103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1523464874,"text":"ウルマンもフォンテーヌに来てたんだね！","nextNodeIds":[746730105]},{"nodeId":746730105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":498397562,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、それにパイモン！こんなところで会えるなんて、奇遇だな。","nextNodeIds":[746730106]},{"nodeId":746730106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4202860506,"text":"相変わらず仙霊に好かれてるんだな。それに…前よりもっと仙霊との交流に慣れた感じがするぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746730107]},{"nodeId":746730107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1368691994,"text":"仙霊が何て言っているのか通訳して。","nextNodeIds":[746730108]},{"nodeId":746730108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2090118186,"text":"おいおい、からかうなよ。俺だってこいつが何を言いたいのかなんて、分からないさ。","nextNodeIds":[746730109]},{"nodeId":746730109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1744746034,"text":"フォンテーヌへは商売をしに来ただけなんだが、水辺を散歩していたら急に、また小さな仙霊につきまとわれてな。","nextNodeIds":[746730110]},{"nodeId":746730110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1953918722,"text":"俺ももう慣れっこだから、後をついて行ってやった。山を越え、峠を越えて、さらに船まで漕いだんだ。","nextNodeIds":[746730111]},{"nodeId":746730111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":4218994410,"text":"で、普通はそれでぴょんぴょん跳ねて、何かが埋まっている場所を教えてくれる。","nextNodeIds":[746730112]},{"nodeId":746730112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":353212946,"text":"だが…こいつは水中に潜っていくんだ。それもどんどん深く…","nextNodeIds":[746730113]},{"nodeId":746730113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1305233786,"text":"——俺はダイビングなんてできない！それに噂だが、この水中には海流のほかにも、色々と危険があるらしくてな…俺は船の上で、こいつが帰ってくるのを待つしかない。","nextNodeIds":[746730114]},{"nodeId":746730114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1854531786,"text":"ところが、あの小さいやつはめげずに俺をあちこち連れて行くんだ…俺は本当にダイビングはできないんだって、分かってくれよ…","nextNodeIds":[746730115,746730117]},{"nodeId":746730115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3112323794,"text":"フォンテーヌの特色は味わえた？","nextNodeIds":[746730116]},{"nodeId":746730116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3694394730,"text":"ああ、たっぷりな。友好的で、情熱的で、善良で…家に帰ることを忘れさせるお国柄だな。はは…","nextNodeIds":[746730119]},{"nodeId":746730119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":346348378,"text":"ってことは、きっとまたオイラたちに行ってくれっていうんだろ？","nextNodeIds":[746730120]},{"nodeId":746730120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":238057586,"text":"その通りだ！話が早い。ありがたいことに、お前たちはここの人たちの影響をあまり受けていないらしいな。","nextNodeIds":[746730121]},{"nodeId":746730121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":4229364570,"text":"「我が親愛なる」フォンテーヌ人の話し方には、もううんざりしてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[746730122]},{"nodeId":746730122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":515282218,"text":"だいたい二十単語の中に敬称が二つ、比喩が三つ、形容詞が六つも入るんだからな…","nextNodeIds":[746730123,746730124]},{"nodeId":746730123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3872980226,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}はいつも率直だから。","nextNodeIds":[746730125]},{"nodeId":746730125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":475249138,"text":"くそ…俺まで影響を受けてる気がするな…さあ、このノートを持っていけ。あのちびっこが連れて行ってくれた場所を全部記してある。","nextNodeIds":[746730126]},{"nodeId":746730126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1679422434,"text":"前と同じように、古鉄銭を見つけたら持ってきてくれ。高値で買い取ろう。","nextNodeIds":[746730127]},{"nodeId":746730127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2112079626,"text":"#じゃあ{NICKNAME}、パイモン。この協力がうまくいくことを願ってるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":746730124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2084691178,"text":"#確かに{M#俺}{F#私}はレトリックには詳しくないかも。","nextNodeIds":[746730125]},{"nodeId":746730117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":39236674,"text":"魔物との遭遇にはもう慣れっこかとばかり。","nextNodeIds":[746730118]},{"nodeId":746730118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":692572666,"text":"確かに慣れてはいるがな。だが…陸なら踵を返して逃げられるが、水中で魔物に出くわしても、俺は全然泳げないんだ！","nextNodeIds":[746730119]},{"nodeId":746730104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3480161050,"text":"#{M#君}{F#あなた}ってやっぱり仙霊に縁があるんだね。","nextNodeIds":[746730105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7467301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30456"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7467301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30456,"speakerName":"ウルマン","count":18},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[174673],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKO